    {
      "id": "p0248-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Asriel unleashes a powerful attack known as \"Hyper Goner\" in English. Toby noted that this is a reference to the final battle in Final Fantasy VI, in which the godlike villain uses his ultimate attack - known as \"Goner\" in English - when his defeat draws near. Toby also noted that it wasn't important to retain this reference in the Japanese script - he only asked that the Japanese name for \"Hyper Goner\" should sound \"extremely powerful and cool\".",
        "raw": "Asriel unleashes a powerful attack known as \"Hyper Goner\" in English. Toby\nnoted that this is a reference to the final battle in Final Fantasy VI, in which the\ngodlike villain uses his ultimate attack - known as \"Goner\" in English - when\nhis defeat draws near. Toby also noted that it wasn't important to retain this\nreference in the Japanese script - he only asked that the Japanese name for\n\"Hyper Goner\" should sound \"extremely powerful and cool\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28782405,
          0.24857143,
          0.89676575,
          0.35203571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2858038,
          0.24785714,
          0.89878599,
          0.35310714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          14,
          15,
          16,
          17
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Asriel 会使出英文名为“Hyper Goner”的强力攻击。Toby 说明，这致敬的是《最终幻想 VI》的最终战：近乎神明的反派即将落败时，会使出英文名为“Goner”（意为“完蛋的人”）的终极攻击。Toby 也说，日文不一定要保留这个典故，只要求“Hyper Goner”的日文名听起来“强得不得了，而且很酷”。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
