    {
      "id": "p0248-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although it was unnecessary, the localizers did preserve this classic Final Fantasy reference. But because \"Goner\" was known in Japanese as \"Missing\", Asriel's \"Hyper Goner\" was localized into Japanese as \"Hyper Missing\".",
        "raw": "Although it was unnecessary, the localizers did preserve this classic Final\nFantasy reference. But because \"Goner\" was known in Japanese as \"Missing\",\nAsriel's \"Hyper Goner\" was localized into Japanese as \"Hyper Missing\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29287466,
          0.51218571,
          0.8847251,
          0.56117143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2858038,
          0.51147143,
          0.89878599,
          0.56224286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          23,
          24
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "虽然不是硬性要求，团队还是保留了这处对经典《最终幻想》的致敬。但因为“Goner”在日文里叫“Missing”，Asriel 的“Hyper Goner”便译成了“Hyper Missing”（超级消失）。",
        "status": "draft",
