    {
      "id": "p0248-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Perhaps I should set these depressing topics aside and share a Japanese recipe instead. One of the best down-home recipes in Japan is Japanese curry. It's basically a warm, hearty stew with vegetables or meat or anything else, but with a rich, mouthwatering flavor. I want it to finally be popular where I'm from, so I hope you'll try making some sometime!",
        "raw": "Perhaps I should set these depressing topics aside and share a Japanese\nrecipe instead. One of the best down-home recipes in Japan is Japanese\ncurry. It's basically a warm, hearty stew with vegetables or meat or\nanything else, but with a rich, mouthwatering flavor. I want it to finally\nbe popular where I'm from, so I hope you'll try making some sometime!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.32269344,
          0.63198571,
          0.85629018,
          0.7117
